   "description": "The Rarest Combination. The Most Coveted FILTHY 13. Green dials are the hallmark of the serious watch collector — rare, evocative, and deeply rooted in military watch tradition. Pair that with a bronze case that develops its own living patina, and you have the FILTHY 13 Bronze Green Dial: the most distinctive piece in the collection and a true evolution of the legendary Dirty Dozen watches that defined military timekeeping in WWII. The deep green dial plays off the warm, earthy tones of the bronze case in a way that no other combination can match. As the bronze ages, the interplay between case and dial shifts and deepens — making this a watch that becomes more beautiful with every passing year. It's a collector's piece that you actually wear. Case Material: Bronze — develops a unique, personal patina over time Dial Color: Green — rare, military-inspired, deeply collectible Available Strap Colors: Black, Khaki, Army Green Collection: FILTHY 13 — an evolution of the Dirty Dozen For the collector who wants the one that turns heads at every watch meetup. This is it.",
