   "availability": "in_stock",
   "description": "Raw Character. Earned Patina. Unmatched Presence. The FILTHY 13 Bronze Black Dial is not for the faint of heart. It's for the collector who understands that a watch should tell more than just time — it should tell a story. Rooted in the legacy of the Dirty Dozen, the WWII-era military watches that defined the tool watch genre, the FILTHY 13 Bronze takes that heritage and pushes it into bold new territory. Bronze is a living material. From the moment you strap this watch on, it begins to develop a unique patina shaped by your environment, your skin chemistry, your life. No two bronze FILTHY 13s will ever look the same. The black dial anchors the warm tones of the case with striking contrast — dark, dramatic, and impossible to ignore. Case Material: Bronze — develops a unique patina over time Dial Color: Black — bold contrast against the warm bronze case Available Strap Colors: Black, Khaki, Army Green Collection: FILTHY 13 — an evolution of the Dirty Dozen This is a watch that ages with you. If you want something that looks the same in ten years as it does today, look elsewhere. If you want something extraordinary, this is it.",
