   "description": "Clarity Under Pressure. Precision Without Compromise. The FILTHY 13 Stainless Steel White Dial carries the soul of the legendary Dirty Dozen — the iconic military-issued watches of WWII — and forges it into something built for today's discerning collector. This is tool watch heritage, refined and reborn. The 316L surgical-grade stainless steel case delivers the durability and corrosion resistance demanded by serious wearers. The white dial brings a crisp, high-contrast legibility that reads instantly in any light — clean, confident, and unmistakably purposeful. Whether you're in the field or the boardroom, this watch commands attention without asking for it. Case Material: 316L Stainless Steel Dial Color: White — clean contrast, timeless legibility Available Strap Colors: Black, Khaki, Army Green Collection: FILTHY 13 — an evolution of the Dirty Dozen. The white dial is the choice of the collector who appreciates restraint — a watch that speaks through precision, not flash. Pair it with any of three strap colors to make it entirely your own.",
