   "description": "Born from the Battlefield. Built for the Bold. The FILTHY 13 Stainless Steel Black Dial is the definitive tool watch for those who demand more from their wrist. Inspired by the legendary Dirty Dozen — the 12 watches commissioned by the British Ministry of Defence in WWII — the FILTHY 13 collection is an unapologetic evolution of that storied heritage, engineered for the modern operator. The 316L surgical-grade stainless steel case delivers the durability and corrosion resistance demanded by serious wearers. The deep black dial brings a crisp, high-contrast legibility that reads instantly in any light — clean, confident, and unmistakably purposeful. Whether you're in the field or the boardroom, this watch commands attention without asking for it. Case Material: 316L Stainless Steel Dial Color: Black — maximum contrast, maximum readability Available Strap Colors: Black, Khaki, Army Green Collection: FILTHY 13 — an evolution of the Dirty Dozen This is not a dress watch. This is not a fashion piece. This is a tool — precise, purposeful, and built to outlast everything you put it through.",
